# flux to 0.196 g m-2 s-1 and made the growth clock 1.2 times early. The growth law already carries
# the flame radius, so most of the oxygen-demand argument is inside it: the energy balance leaves
# -0.03 and a fixed heat-release flux -0.007. The train days ask for about +0.04. Typed: the half-step
# from -0.085, to one figure. Allowed range -0.085 to +0.05.
